WEBVTT

00:19.910 --> 00:23.390
Damn, that hurts...

00:25.810 --> 00:30.460
Sorry, Master Suou... I failed.

00:34.770 --> 00:37.610
I wish I could've patted you more...

00:52.730 --> 00:54.000
Lykos, don't!

00:58.530 --> 00:59.530
Hold your fire!

01:06.950 --> 01:09.640
Well, if it isn't Commander Orka's sister.

02:43.410 --> 02:45.140
This could only have been my brother's idea.

02:46.320 --> 02:48.890
Custom states that no blood is to be spilled before the nous.

02:49.760 --> 02:54.250
Only he could so fearlessly commit this taboo.

02:55.720 --> 02:56.900
Just give up.

02:57.730 --> 03:00.240
There is nothing you can do in this situation.

03:07.440 --> 03:10.420
So you choose to resist even when it is futile.

03:11.200 --> 03:13.250
You are a child without even your thymia.

03:14.120 --> 03:15.370
You leave me no choice.

03:19.050 --> 03:19.720
Don't move.

03:21.560 --> 03:23.930
All of you, drop your weapons.

03:24.570 --> 03:27.390
One false move and I'll slice his neck open.

03:32.070 --> 03:32.770
Lykos!

03:34.980 --> 03:36.190
Lykos.

03:42.710 --> 03:45.660
Tokusa... everyone...

03:47.490 --> 03:48.240
Chakuro!

03:48.870 --> 03:50.200
Get to the nous!

03:52.490 --> 03:53.570
Ouni...

03:58.110 --> 03:59.050
<i>Calm down.</i>

04:00.560 --> 04:02.800
<i>I need to save the Mud Whale.</i>

04:04.520 --> 04:07.020
<i>I have to think of the most important thing!</i>

04:10.390 --> 04:12.190
Lykos, let's go!

04:18.700 --> 04:21.270
<i>Is the nous back there?</i>

04:23.810 --> 04:25.110
<i>What is this?</i>

04:25.980 --> 04:27.150
<i>Someone's there.</i>

04:43.560 --> 04:44.800
Ouni!

04:54.610 --> 04:57.190
Hey, Nibikko! Mojamoja! What's going on?!

04:57.190 --> 04:59.790
How would I know?! And don't call me that!

05:01.120 --> 05:03.240
Their timing is too good.

05:03.600 --> 05:05.830
Shit, we've been pincered.

05:06.340 --> 05:09.330
Screw it, the three of us will just have to hold the fort.

05:09.330 --> 05:11.600
Right, Nibik...ko?

06:15.510 --> 06:17.230
Mommy, it's growing hands.

06:17.230 --> 06:18.320
What?

06:20.420 --> 06:21.610
What are...

06:21.970 --> 06:23.670
They're going "glug-glug".

06:23.670 --> 06:25.590
Aren't they warm?

06:38.620 --> 06:41.170
It seems the fields and residential areas are clear.

06:41.880 --> 06:46.050
Moreover, the counterattacks appear to originate from the four towers.

06:46.050 --> 06:48.670
The location of the objective is becoming clearer.

06:49.680 --> 06:52.230
Kill them all upon finding it.

06:52.850 --> 06:57.570
Our mission is the execution of every one of Falaina's sinners.

06:59.410 --> 07:02.820
By the way, what happened to the lion cub in your squad?

07:02.820 --> 07:05.610
You mean Liodari? He's, well...

07:07.180 --> 07:09.190
Gone solo again, huh?

07:11.340 --> 07:15.770
I'm gonna make you cry, eyepatch!

07:28.190 --> 07:29.440
Captain!

07:31.090 --> 07:32.800
Master Suou...

07:39.030 --> 07:41.140
You're terribly hurt...

07:46.200 --> 07:47.390
What is this?

07:48.430 --> 07:50.470
These things like fingers...

07:53.760 --> 07:56.240
<i>They're as warm as a person's touch.</i>

07:57.830 --> 08:00.750
<i>It feels like the Mud Whale itself is alive.</i>

08:13.930 --> 08:15.420
<i>Neri?</i>

08:27.650 --> 08:28.910
<i>Something...</i>

08:30.440 --> 08:33.910
<i>is appearing in my head.</i>

08:44.060 --> 08:45.280
<i>Something...</i>

08:46.260 --> 08:48.060
<i>is appearing in my head.</i>

09:07.880 --> 09:08.750
It's him...

09:08.750 --> 09:09.480
Him?

09:09.480 --> 09:10.310
That's him...

09:10.310 --> 09:11.860
It's really him...

09:11.860 --> 09:13.280
That's him...

09:14.590 --> 09:16.910
Stop!

09:27.320 --> 09:30.230
He jumped from the window of his school.

09:30.230 --> 09:31.800
More abnormal conduct?

09:32.980 --> 09:35.420
This kind of brother brings shame to our family.

09:36.060 --> 09:39.540
We need simply to lock him away at home.

09:39.540 --> 09:40.930
He's sick.

09:41.990 --> 09:44.440
His emotions have run amok and are out of his control.

09:44.960 --> 09:52.860
Even though he hasn't eaten sarx, he was the only child left whole, emotions unconsumed by the nous.

09:53.510 --> 09:59.600
If I had to postulate a reason, there must have been an
accident during his first pilgrimage to the nous Anthropos.

10:00.390 --> 10:02.870
He repeatedly said that it "backflowed" into him.

10:03.570 --> 10:06.370
Liodari, what backflowed?

10:06.370 --> 10:10.520
Mommy, there were lots of hearts!

10:10.520 --> 10:12.010
And all of them actually—

10:12.010 --> 10:14.150
Liodari, that's enough.

10:28.680 --> 10:35.900
What's truly inside people's hearts is a huge flower field...

10:36.960 --> 10:43.870
totally drowned in disgusting mud and raging fires!

10:45.630 --> 10:52.330
They were all filthy and tainted inside, but they try to act like dolls and cover that up with pretty words!

10:53.080 --> 10:54.890
That's just boring!

10:56.630 --> 11:04.180
But everyone here is despised by the whole world and on the verge of death, and yet they're full of life!

11:07.020 --> 11:09.270
I love you all!

11:18.450 --> 11:21.580
I saw your heart just now.

11:23.040 --> 11:24.530
If your sorrow is such,

11:25.640 --> 11:29.870
and if your world is painful,
you should live with us instead!

11:32.050 --> 11:35.380
Even you, like Lykos, can stay here.

11:53.740 --> 11:56.230
Don't do that, Chieftain.

11:56.840 --> 12:01.400
If they were all like that girl,
we wouldn't be at war right now.

12:01.960 --> 12:06.770
Do you honestly think we can be friends with someone who killed so many of ours?

12:12.580 --> 12:14.120
<i>Falaina is uneasy.</i>

12:15.630 --> 12:18.630
<i>The boundaries are all wavering.</i>

12:20.730 --> 12:22.760
So this is the power of nous Falaina...

12:24.080 --> 12:26.930
It pries inside you without permission...

12:29.620 --> 12:32.070
Don't you dare get me wrong.

12:34.730 --> 12:37.730
Who ever said they wanted to live with you?

12:40.110 --> 12:43.530
Doesn't seeing someone with such lively eyes make you want to butcher them?

12:43.530 --> 12:47.600
All I want is to mutilate everyone pretending to be human!

12:47.600 --> 12:51.210
What could possibly be more fun?!

12:51.210 --> 12:52.750
Dumbass!

12:56.240 --> 12:58.130
You're lucky it feels fun to you.

13:08.970 --> 13:11.770
Living is just a drag for me.

13:12.960 --> 13:15.890
But if what you say is right...

13:18.650 --> 13:26.450
even I should be able to feel alive by doing this!

13:59.100 --> 14:02.150
No... I don't want to die...

14:03.370 --> 14:05.780
No... no...

14:06.650 --> 14:08.160
No!

14:11.710 --> 14:13.540
No!

14:23.500 --> 14:25.170
No...

14:28.400 --> 14:29.010
Don't chase him!

14:33.360 --> 14:36.540
He can no longer do anything.

14:37.490 --> 14:41.050
Instead of finishing off your enemies,

14:41.710 --> 14:45.800
I want you to think of saving even one more of your friends.

14:48.010 --> 14:49.280
Please.

14:55.500 --> 14:58.830
<i>If you have the will to live, you should.</i>

15:00.190 --> 15:05.090
<i>I'm envious you can even feel that way, bob cut.</i>

15:06.830 --> 15:10.430
No, no, no...

15:10.980 --> 15:13.390
No... no...

15:14.200 --> 15:15.890
<i>I don't want to die yet.</i>

15:19.860 --> 15:21.010
<i>I'll live.</i>

15:22.910 --> 15:25.480
<i>There's still so much fun out there.</i>

15:26.480 --> 15:28.740
<i>I'll execute every last one of them.</i>

15:29.810 --> 15:31.450
<i>I'll make them cry.</i>

15:33.050 --> 15:35.590
<i>They actually react to me.</i>

15:37.330 --> 15:39.570
<i>I've finally found my paradise.</i>

15:40.550 --> 15:45.210
<i>I want to play so much more with the people of Falaina.</i>

15:45.210 --> 15:46.260
It's an enemy!

15:51.690 --> 15:54.560
He's all bloody... I'm scared.

15:54.560 --> 15:56.430
It's okay, we'll get him!

15:56.430 --> 15:57.440
But...

15:57.440 --> 15:58.780
We can do it!

16:08.380 --> 16:12.410
More... you can be scared even more.

16:13.860 --> 16:18.330
Come on, I'll play with you all you want!

16:22.150 --> 16:23.040
It hit!

16:38.600 --> 16:41.100
<i>There are so many flowers.</i>

16:42.400 --> 16:45.400
<i>I'm filled to the brim.</i>

16:46.460 --> 16:49.360
<i>Filled with a heart beyond my control.</i>

16:50.470 --> 16:52.310
<i>The world is crazy.</i>

16:53.510 --> 16:57.280
<i>Nobody could possibly understand me.</i>

17:25.360 --> 17:27.270
Hey, Kicha.

17:28.010 --> 17:31.360
Don't you think we should've met up with our group too?

17:31.910 --> 17:33.860
What'll we do if the enemy shows up?

17:35.500 --> 17:39.810
The group's probably fighting for their lives right now.

17:39.810 --> 17:41.480
It's the same wherever you go.

17:42.020 --> 17:45.000
Besides, what would we do with the prisoner?

17:45.000 --> 17:48.760
If we don't watch her, she might escape back to her allies.

17:48.760 --> 17:50.630
M-Maybe, but...

17:52.740 --> 17:55.300
Where did the person with long hair go?

17:56.500 --> 17:59.050
Why are you suddenly worried about Ouni?

18:00.700 --> 18:02.220
Say something!

18:05.200 --> 18:06.560
And Nibi...

18:07.050 --> 18:10.440
Nibi definitely went along with Ouni.

18:12.150 --> 18:13.730
It's no fair.

18:14.970 --> 18:17.320
Even I wanted to...

18:17.320 --> 18:18.590
Nibi, huh.

18:19.280 --> 18:21.450
He's always clinging to Ouni.

18:21.450 --> 18:23.670
Shikon. Shikoku.

18:23.670 --> 18:25.670
He's a total weakling.

18:25.670 --> 18:29.210
Even if he went, it's obvious he'd just hold them back.

18:29.210 --> 18:32.220
Where the hell were you guys hiding?

18:32.220 --> 18:34.090
We weren't hiding.

18:34.090 --> 18:37.530
Those Unmarked decided to go to war all on their own.

18:37.530 --> 18:40.940
Why should we be the ones to pay with our lives?

18:40.940 --> 18:46.430
We bowel moles aren't pawns of the Chieftain. Isn't that right?

18:46.800 --> 18:47.890
Of course...

18:47.890 --> 18:51.400
Then why is Ouni doing whatever Suou wants?!

18:51.400 --> 18:52.770
What's that supposed to mean?

18:52.770 --> 18:58.810
Ouni's out risking his neck fighting on the orders of those useless Unmarked.

18:58.810 --> 19:03.640
Our leader's bowed to the pressure of the authorities.

19:03.640 --> 19:07.620
Don't you think that's strange? Well, Kicha?

19:08.660 --> 19:09.720
I...

19:09.720 --> 19:12.070
Hey, don't fight with your comrades.

19:12.070 --> 19:13.550
And what about you?

19:13.550 --> 19:14.130
Huh?

19:14.130 --> 19:16.560
I see you're hiding an enemy.

19:17.150 --> 19:18.800
Did Suou tell you to do that too?

19:18.800 --> 19:20.410
Like hell he did.

19:20.410 --> 19:24.410
Oh, really? Seems like you're wagging your tails for the Unmarked.

19:24.410 --> 19:25.480
Say that to my face!

19:25.480 --> 19:25.960
Hah?!

19:25.960 --> 19:26.470
Want some?!

19:26.470 --> 19:27.450
Ouni is—

19:29.350 --> 19:33.460
Ouni is there because he chose to go.

19:33.460 --> 19:34.870
Even I...

19:35.980 --> 19:37.820
Even I don't...

19:41.010 --> 19:45.370
I don't... want to be away from Ouni.

19:48.510 --> 19:51.070
Ouni will definitely come back.

19:54.280 --> 19:58.180
He'll definitely come back alive!

20:01.190 --> 20:03.550
Stop wasting time and finish him.

20:03.990 --> 20:05.930
Otherwise I'll shoot you too.

20:05.930 --> 20:07.440
M-My apologies.

20:17.860 --> 20:19.480
Is that true?

20:25.690 --> 20:26.730
Wait.

20:31.010 --> 20:34.310
He appears to be a daimon of Falaina.

20:35.080 --> 20:35.870
Ouni!

20:36.670 --> 20:43.010
So a child like him is one of the cursed mad warriors created on Falaina.

20:43.590 --> 20:45.180
How ridiculous.

20:45.880 --> 20:50.140
It seems as though the prison island has become something of a fairytale land.

20:50.550 --> 20:55.480
The first soldiers to land on Falaina were surprised.

20:55.480 --> 21:00.610
The sinners of Falaina were unaware of their own sin.

21:01.010 --> 21:06.200
You knew nothing of the outside world and were entirely unaware of what happened.

21:07.020 --> 21:09.930
One hundred years have passed since your exile,

21:10.480 --> 21:15.060
but instead of advancing your culture, you regressed.

21:15.060 --> 21:19.290
You created a false paradise by halting your growth with ignorance.

21:19.720 --> 21:25.780
I doubt you are even aware of the reason why you are short-lived.

21:28.900 --> 21:35.650
Sister of Orka, I cannot fathom what could have possibly attracted you to them.

21:35.650 --> 21:42.610
These people are nothing more than characters in a picture book that will never be read.

21:46.140 --> 21:48.280
This has nothing to do with your ancestors' sins.

21:48.820 --> 21:51.200
It is what you yourselves bear that makes you guilty.

21:51.200 --> 21:53.750
The sin of a meaningless existence.

21:54.170 --> 21:55.950
I'll erase you.

21:55.950 --> 21:59.740
In death, you will finally serve a purpose for the world.

22:00.740 --> 22:01.340
Shut up.

22:02.050 --> 22:03.570
Disappear.

22:04.360 --> 22:07.640
Unable to become even the dust above the sands...

22:07.640 --> 22:09.850
disappear from this world.
